  title: "Raffles Hotel \u2013 1887"
  info: "Established in 1887, Raffles Hotel is one of Singapore\u2019s most famous
    colonial-era landmarks. Known for its grand architecture and luxurious hospitality,
    the hotel has hosted celebrities and dignitaries from around the world. It is
    also the birthplace of the iconic Singapore Sling cocktail, symbolizing the city's
    colonial charm and elegance.  "
